{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026dQtXrtWP5K1795439734.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本福島縣被大雪所困的民眾，孤立狀態解除。</p><p></p><p>福島縣裡磐梯地區，周末因大雪令樹木倒塌阻塞公路，900多名居民以及約500名旅客被困，直至周日晚，縣當局完成清理工作後，孤立狀態被解除。</p><p></p><p>民眾被困約30小時期間，當局曾出動直升機，運送食物和飲用水到該區。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T23:02:30.194390+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T11:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T01:27:50.823680+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T22:55:49.522992+00:00","content_hash":"1ecae2f322da3a36ddfe9c219a315a4fc6c9613b8df8f4cc9e44798b3f3f4785","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T23:02:30.194390+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}